<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- BUU</book>
  <para style="h">2CO - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc1">2CO - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc2">2CO - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc3">2CO - BUU</para>
  <para style="mt1">2CO - BUU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Imbe nyi zhu ri me Bulus ivren ndu Izhi nga vayi mbu Timoti, hi ri wawa wa hu Izhi ri Tsitsri ri gbu Korantus nga Akaya:<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />No dindi ti riwa A ti mbu Izhi nga Bachi Yeso Kristo no he ri yi.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izhi Riwa ari de Sisron ri nji wawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Ki gbre Izhi nga A ti mbu riwa a he Ti Bachi mbu Yeso Kristo, wawu riwa a he A ti riwa ari lo sron, Izhi riwa ari no ta sisron. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />A no ta sisron bibi riwa kita ngawen ki no wari sisron inde wari wa he ri shnji sron, kita ki no wa sisron bibi riwa Izhi no ta. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Bibi riwa iya Kristo shan gra ta ri kpa, ngamba nye ki fe sisron Izhi dzu ri wo Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Inde ki so yaa, rimba he sisron nye wa no ta, inde a he sisron nye wa no ta, biyi ngawen bi fe sisron nye mba, riwa bi vu sron bibi yaa riwa kita ngawen ki so. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Bibi yaa riwa bi so ka kita, ngamba nye biyi bi fe sisron riwa Izhi ri no ta. <verse eid="2CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Imiri vayi wa hu Izhi, ki ran ri wa no yi hon to bibi yaa riwa ki so ri meme Asiya ran. Iyaa nyi a bran mgbazhi ran, ki ran to ri ki nawo ran. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Kpunji tre ki yonga wa bla yo rita ri ki kuu. Ama rinyi he nganyi ritu ki ran yosron ri ngambu ran, tsede ki ka yo sron ri Izhi riwa ari ta wawa wa kuu shime. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Izhi riwa a kpata chuwo rimi meme kuu ki yo sron ri wu ritu riwa ari sondu kpata ran chuwo, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />riwa bi zon ta rimi bre, ngamba nye ikpa nji wa ngiri ri Izhi ritu mbu ritu dindi ti riwa ki fe ritu kpa nyime bre mbu wa kigbu.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a Sran tre hi Zren wan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Ikya riwa ari no ta chonkpon wan nye he rimɨren sron mbu ri la ta ri ki sonson ri Tsitsri ri mgbumgblume ri sron riri, a zizan iki riwa kpunji tre bibi riwa Izhi, ritu dindi ti Izhi nye a ran he ritu wiwiri riwa mgbumgblume ngaran. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Ki ran ngan mbe nyi no yi bibi riwa bi ran hon to-u ran ko bi ri hon kra-u ran. Me yo sron ri chachu ri bi to ta kre, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />ko bi ran to ta kre zizan ran. Ritu chachu riwa Bachi mbu Yeso ri ye, bi tankpon ritu mbu, bibi riwa kita ngawen ki tankpon ritu mbi.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Ri bibi nyɨme nyi, me yosron riwa me gbuchi ye ri yi, ritu bi ri fe tilɨbu ti mkpa hari. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Me yosron ri me ye ri yi ka me hi ri meme Makidoniya me bru dzu ri yi nga inde me bru ye me bru hu ri yi inde me bru ri ye, ritu me fe dzon mbi ritu izren won hi ri Yudiya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Bi to ri me ti kya wa nyi a ran ri me ran to kya riwa me ti ran? Ka, bi to ri me ti kya nyi rimi kpa nye, ritu me ri tre, een,&lt;&lt;Me ri bru tre, onhon&lt;&lt;?<verse eid="2CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Bibi riwa a he kpunji Izhi he ri kpa nyɨme nye, ngambame itre riwa ki tre ri yi a ran he,&lt;&lt;Een&gt;&gt;Ngha &lt;&lt;Onhon ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Ritu ivren Izhi Yeso Kristo, riwa ame ri Sila nga Timoti, ki bla tre wan ri yi, a ran he,&lt;&lt;Een&gt;&gt;Nga,&lt;&lt;Onhon ran&gt;&gt;Ama ri wu a he,&lt;&lt;Een nye bla vi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Ritu wan nye Izhi ka tre wan dzi riwa a ti. Ritu Yeso Kristo nye ki tre ri,&lt;&lt;No he ngamba&gt;&gt;Ritu mkpen Izhi. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Zizan Izhi nye ri nyɨme ta, ri kita ri biyi wawu, ife vri rimi Kristo wawu nye kɨma ta dzi, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />a no ta nkpen riwa a tsro ri kita ki he wa ma, nga ran no ta wu wan ri sron mbu ritu ran no ta ki to kya riwa ari ti-u kusi. <verse eid="2CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Izhi nye he shada won, inde a he che nye me ti riwa me tre ikya riwa a ti meri ran bru ye ri Korantu ran ritu me ran bru no yi yaa ran. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />A ran ritu ki wa ki ri samgbren ritu wanyi nye ran, ritu bi ri ti kinklan sron, ritu bi ki mgbemgben ritu yosron mbi.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Ritu ngamba me yosron ri me ran bru ye ri yi me ri no yi ti shnji sron ran. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />To, ka me no yi ti shnji sron, inga ri no sron won ngɨri, imba nji riwa me ran no ti shnji sron ran? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Ikya riwa a ti ko me ngan mbe mu ri yi wawu nye he ritu me ran wa me ye fe nji riwa wa no wen kinklan sron, no to kpa sron won time. Ritu me to ri ka me ngɨri, wawu mbi angawen bi ngɨri. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Me ngan nyi ri yi me he rimi yaa ri shnji sron bran, nga ri ima si bran bran a ran ritu me ri no yi ti shnji sron ran, tsede ritu bi ri to bibi riwa me nyɨme yi bran bran.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ika Memeti nji riwa a ti Memeti rega</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Idan njo a ngɨzhi shnji sron ye, a ran ri mo nye a ngɨzhi ye ran, ama ri nkon ri a ti ri wawu mbi nye, me ran ri la nganyi ritu me ri kri ri yi to ran. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Iya riwa nyi a so ri nkon nye ri wari mbi, a tsra ngamba. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Zizan nganyi, bi ka meme ti wan rega ri wu, nga bi ri no si sron, ritu bi ri ran ka-u chuwo no shnji sron zan mgbembren wan ran. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Ritu ngamba me ibreyi no yi noo no to ri bi nyɨme-u bran bran. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Me ngan mbe nyi ri yi ritu me ri tsra yi to, me ri to ko bi milan ki bi ri hu tre won ko shitan. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />ko ngaa riwa bi ka meme ti wan rega wawu, ame ngawen me ka meme ti wan rega ri wu. Ikya riwa me ka rega inde ikya riwa wa ka rega he, me ka rega ritu mbi ritu Kristo, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />Ritu no meme nji no ran fe nkon gyuru ta ran, ritu ki to wiwiri wan ri rira.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indu Bulus ri Toruwas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Riwa me ye ri Toruwas ritu me ri la raro tre riwa Kristo, Bachi a bu nkon ri mo me ri ti ndu ri nyi, <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />ama me ti shnji sron bran riwa me ran to vayi won Titus ri nyi ran. Ritu ngamba me ka wa chuwo me ri ka hi ri gbu Makidoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Ama me ngɨri ri Izhi riwa ari no ta ki ri gben bla ri rimi Kristo. Ari ti ndu ri ta ritu ki ngɨzhi tre Kristo hi ko kutan ka nye ri kpangu raro riwa wa bu. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Kita ki he ka nye riwa ari kpangu raro riwa Kristo ka no Izhi, riwa a shan gra rimi wawa wa kpa wa chuwo nga wawa wa he ri nkon kuu. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Ri wawa wa he ri nkon kuu-a ikpa-ngua he ka ikuu nye, riwa ari ngɨzhi ku ye, ama ri wawa wa fe kpa chu won, ikpa-a a he hwi riwa ari ngɨzhi vri ye njo ran he riwa a to ban ndu riwa a ron nyi ran. <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Kita wanyi ki ran he bibi riwa mgbron nji wa he ran, wawa wa la tre Izhi ritu wa ri fe nkren ran. Ama ritu riwa Izhi ti ta ki la tre rimi kpunji ri kusi wan, riwa ki ti ndu Kristo.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Ko ngamba ki gbuchi ran gbre ngambu nye mba? Ka ki wa ngaa mbe riwa ari tsro hi ri yi, ko zhu ri yi, bibi riwa wari mba wa ti? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Biyi kyumbi nye bi he mbe riwa ki he ri wu, riwa Kristo ngan ri sron mbu ritu no ko ngaa no to nga ran kra. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Bi tsro ri biyi bi he mbe riwa Kristo riwa a he ritu ndu mbu wa ngan ri wu ran, ama wa ngan ri Yuu Izhi riwa ari vri, wa ngan ritu kya ri ngan ri tita ran, ama ri sron wa nji.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Ki la nganyi ritu ki he ri nyɨme ri kusi Izhi dzu ri Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Ki ran he ri kya riwa ki tsro ri a he ti mbu nye ki ti ndu nyi ran. Iti mbu a zhu ri Izhi nye ye. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Ritu wan nye ki to he wa ti ndu sisa nyɨme riwa a ri hu ri doka Musa nye wa ngan ran ama a hu ri Yuu; doka nyi riwa a he ri ngan wawu nye ri ngɨzhi kuu ye, ama Iyu ri de vri.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkpen Ri Katredzi Sisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Wa ngan tsro tre doka Musa ri tu wa ŋɨma tita, nga mkpen Izhi a zhu riwa wa he kusi Musa a he riwa ŋɨma riwa ikpa wan a no wa ngɨzhi Israilawa wa ran to ndzu si ya kusi wan ran idan itsro riwa a ngɨzhi kuu ye ri ye ri gbre ngɨzhi, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />to, ko ibran igibreri ndu Yuu ri he ri se? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Inde ikya riwa ari ngɨzhi kuu ye ri fe gbre, lele ikya riwa ari ngɨzhi ti tsra riwa Izhi a han ri gbre! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Kpunji tre, igibreriwa nyɨme ri kɨmo a ran he kya ri zizan ran, inde wa tsra-u ri bi ri nyɨme ri sisa. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Inde ikya nyi ri kre ri ye ri gbre, ari he ri bi ri kya nyi riwa ari he a ran kre ran!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Ritu ki he ri bibi yosron nyi, ritu wan nye ki he ri vu sron bran. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Kita ki ran he ka Musa ran, riwa a ka si wan ri tsro ran, ritu no Israilawa no wa ran to igibreriwa ari kre ran. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Ama ivu sron mba a a ran senkpa ran, ritu ye luwa ikyari he riwa ari kawa si ri to kpunji nyi inde wa kra nyɨme ri kɨmo-a ye zazan wa ran chu wu zho ran tsede ri Kristo ka kre. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Ye zizan, inde wa kra mbe Musa, imba itsro-a ka ka sron mba. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Ama wa to chu wu zho inde nji kɨma sron wan ye ri Izhi. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />To Bachi nye he Yuu. Bubu riwa Iyu Bachi he, bubu wan nye nji wa fe son ri sontu. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Kita wawa wa ran ka ta si ran ki tsro kpan ri nkpen riwa Bachi ka Iyu ri ya si nga wa sran ta ki he ka wawu. Isran kpa riwa wa ti rita ari gra rimi gbre riwa a zhu ri Bachi, riwa a he Yuu nye.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Iwo ri Yuu rimi Vaja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Ritu ngamba, tunde ki he ri ndu nyi ri bibi losron Izhi ki ran chu sron mbu zho ran. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Ki kambu ri ya wa yayibi bibi ri meme ti riwa wa he kya ri shan ki kambu ri gyuru nga tiche ri tre Izhi ran, ama ki la kpunji ri ra. Ri nganyi nye ko ri de nyɨme rita ri kusi Izhi rimi sron wan. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Inde itre ri ro nyi riwa ki wo a he ri yayɨbi, a he ri yayɨbi ri wawa wa he rimi meme ti. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Wawa wa ran kpanyɨme ran, ritu meme nji riwa a he zhi ri nzan nyi a ka sron mba suu a dzu wa ri to kpan riwa ari kpan wa, ikpan nyi riwa ari zhu rimi tre ri ro riwa ari gbre Kristo riwa wawu nye he ka Izhi. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Ritu a ran tre Izhi ri tu mbu nye ki la ran, tsede riwa Yeso Kristo, iri wawu nye he Bachi kita ki he ka gran mbi ritu Yeso. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Izhi he riri,&lt;&lt;No kpan no kpan ri bu,&gt;&gt;Wawu nye ri no kpan wan no kpan rimi sron mbu, ritu no wa kpa nji no wa to gbre Izhi ri kusi Yeso Kristo.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Ri ngamba kita wawa ki he ri wo riwa Yuu, ki he ka wa vaja riwa wa mme ri meme. Kita ki he ngamba ritu no wa tsro ri gbengbren riwa a he wa Izhi nye, a ran he ri ta ran. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Wa no ta yaa ri nkon kankankan, ri ngamba me ran ri wa no ta ki kambu ri ndu-a ran. Ri vi wari ki si kambu ri kpanyɨme, ama ki ran chu sron mbu zho ran; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Wari wa no ta yaa ri ko kutan, ri ngamba Izhi ran kata chuwo ran ri vi wari wa tsi ta yo ri meme, kau ri ngamba wa ran wuu ta ran. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Bla vi ki he ri nyu nkon kuu bibi riwa wa ti ri Yeso ritu no tsro son Yeso rimi ngamba nye riwa ari kuu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Wawu vi mbu ri mgbumgblume, ki he nyu kuu ritu Yeso, ritu no nji no wa to bibi son Yeso ri kpa mbu nyi riwa ari kuu. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Ritu wan nye ki to kuu ritu bi ri fe vri riwa a ran kre ran.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Mbe Izhi tre ri,&lt;&lt;Me kpanyɨme, ritu ngamba me tre.&gt;&gt;Tunde ki he ri Yuu kpanyɨme bibi riri, to kita ngawen ki kpanyɨme, ritu ngamba nye ngawen ki tre. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Ki to ri Izhi riwa a ta Bachi Yeso shɨme ri kuu, ari tata shɨme iwawa Yeso, nga ran kata de ri ku si wan iwayi. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Ikya wanyi wawu wa he ritu no dzon yi ritu riwa dindi ti Izhi sondu ri shan ri nji kigbu, ari he kya riwa ki ran ngɨri ri Izhi, ritu no wa gbre wu. <verse eid="2CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Ritu ngamba ki ran chu sron mbu zho ran ko ri wa ikpa mbu sondu ri time, ka hu ri ngamba wa kɨma wu mbu no he sisa bla vi. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Bibi yaa riwa ki so nyi a ran ri ban vi bran ran ari ngɨzhi gbre ye ri ta bran riwa a han kya riwa ki to, nga a ri he hi a ran kre ran. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />A ran kya riwa isi ri to nye ki ya ran, tsede kya riwa ki ran ri to ran ikya riwa ki to wa wa chichi vuyɨba, ama ikya riwa ki ran ri to wa ran wa ran kre ran.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Bubu son mbu ri Shu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Zizan ki to iri ka wa zii tra mbu nyi riwa ki son rimi wan, wa tre ritu kpa mbu ri mgbumgblu me nyi Izhi ri tuwan a mme ko rita ri shu mu. Iko nyi a ran he nji nye mme ran, ari he ngamba a ran kre ran. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Zizan mba, ki ka sron mbu ri dzi, ki ti nye bran itu ki kiri fe kpa nyi riwa wa ka dzi rita ri shu, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />inde Izhi vu su ri ta ki ran ki ri mgbireran. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Ritu ki kii rimi kpa nyi ri mgbumgblume nyi, ki ran kpachu ritu yaa riwa ki so, ki ran wa ki ri ka kpa mbu ri mgbumgblume nyi chuwo ran, ama ki wa ki ri suu riwa a he ri shu, ritu a he riwa a ran kre ran a sran kya ri kuu iwawu. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Izhi kyuwan nye sran ta kpa nyi, nga ran no ta Yuu wan ritu ran no ta ki to kya riwa ari ti ri ta kusi. <verse eid="2CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Ritu wan nye ki vu sron bla vi, nga inde ki he ri kpa nyi ri mgbumgblume, to ki he kpa ri ko mbu riwa a he ri Bachi. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Nghamba ki dzren ri kpanyɨme nye, a ran ri kya riwa ki to ri si ran. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Ki he ri vu sron, nga ki wa kiri ka kpa nyi chuwo kiri son ri Bachi ri shu. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Ki yo sron ri, ki wa ki ri no si sron ko ki he ri shu? ko ka ki he ri mgbumgblu mme. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Ritu dole wawu mbu ki kii ri kusi Kristo ritu no bla tre rita nga ko ngaa ri kpa kya bibi ri ndu riwa a ti ri mgbumgblume nyi, ko dindi ko meme wan.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indu Milan Treti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Riwa ki to kya riwa wa tre ritu wan ka wa tre ritu sisiri Bachi, ritu wan nye ki wa ki ngɨzhi wa ri ye ri Izhi no to bibi riwa ki he, nga me to ri bi to ri nyi rimi sron mbi. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Ki ran wa kiri gbre ngambu ri kusi mbi ran, tsede ki wa ki ti kya dindi ri wa ki sii yi sron, ritu bi to nyɨme tre ri wawa wa kpo ngamba ritu kpanchi mba ritu ti mba. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Ki ran ri sra bibi riwa wa ri wa tre ran, ki ti ritu gbre Izhi idan ki ran ri sra ran, ri nyi he ritu mbi nye. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Ko ngye ki ti, ki ran ri ti-u ritu ki ri fe kya ritu wan ran, ama ritu nyɨme Kristo riwa ari tsro ta riwa ki kpanyɨme ri Kristo kuu ritu nji wawu ritu ngamba ari he ka wawu mbu ki kuu ri wu. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Wawu kuu ritu wawa wa he ri sii, no wa ran son bibi son riwa wa son ri kusi ran, tsede no son ritu a kuu ritu mba, nga wa ta shɨme ritu mba.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Ritu ngamba ban kusi ki ran bru rimɨren ritu to nji ngaran ritu ko riwa ki rimɨren ritu Kristo ri bibi to riwa nji, zizan wa ran bru taka wan ngaran. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Ritu ngamba, ka nji he rimi Kristo a he nji sisa nye mba, kyawa wa kɨmo wa vu yɨba, nga ko ngye he sisa! <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Wawu kya wanyi wa he wa Izhi nye, riwa a ka dzi ri tsutsu mbu iwawa Kristo, nga ran no ta ndu ri milan son iwawa nji nga Izhi: <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Ndu mbu wawu nye riwa Izhi ri milan son nji nga wawa he ri Kristo, a ran ri bla meme ti mba ritu mba ran, Izhi no ta ndu ri bla tre wanji wawu. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Ritu ngamba kita ki he sii riwa Kristo, ka wawu Izhi ritu wan ri tre dzu ri ta rimi nde Kristo, ki ibreyi no yi milan son mbi ti ri Izhi bi ri he kpan wan, a ran wawa wa he kpan fu wan ran. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kristo ran ti meme ti zari to ran, ama ritu mbu Izhi kɨma Yeso he ka nji ri ti meme ti: Ritu ngamba nye, rimi kabrutu mbu ri Kristo, ki to fe dindi ti Izhi.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Rimi ndu mbu riwa Izhi, ki ibreyi biyi wawa bi fe dindi ti Izhi ran kau chuwo no he kuklu ran. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Wo kya riwa Izhi tre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">&lt;&lt;Ri vi ri dindi ti me sren to ri yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">riwa ivi ri kpa chuwo a ye me dzon yi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Ngye ga rinyi nye he vi riwa bi kpa dindi ti Izhi, luwa nye he vi ri kpa chuwo.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iso Yaa Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Ki ran he nkon kɨbu dza njo ran, ritu no wa ran fe nkon ri kra ndu mbu tu ran. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Riwa ari he ngamba, ikya riwa ki ti, ki ti-u ritu ki ri tsro ri kita ki he wa ndu Izhi nye ki ti nganyi rimi vu sron, ri so yaa, nga ri wanyu; <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />wa tsi ta, wari vu ta tren ri tra tren, wari dru ta kpa ti njon, kiri ran tindu riwa a dzan gbengbren mbu, ki ran kru na ran ri iyon mi bɨrengha; <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Ri Tsitsri sron, nga ito riwa ki he ri wu, ri vu sron nga ti kya dindi, ki tsro ri kita ki he wa ndu Izhi ri Yu Tsitsri nga nyɨme mbu ri kpunji; <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />Ngha ndu mbu ri kpunji, nga gbengbren Izhi ki he ri dindi ti riwa wawu nye he ka ikpi ku riwa ki ngɨzhi kuwo ri nga kuwo ta. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Wa gbre ta nga wari no ta yaa, nga wari ri tre tre ri kpa nde mbu time wa kɨma ta ti wa ti che, ka hu ri ngamba ki ta ki la tre ri kpunji; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />A he ka wa ran to ta zari ran, ama wa to ta kre. A he ka ki he ri nyu kuu, ama kita ki he ri sii, wa sondu no ta yaa ama wa ran wu ta ran; <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />rimi yaa, ki to fe kya riwa ari no ta kinklan sron, ka hu ri riwa ki ran he ri kyari ran, ama ki no kpanji wa he ri kyawa. A zhu ka kita ki ran he ri kyari ran, ama kongye he wa mbu.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Biyi nji Korentiya, ki ran ri ti kyari ri yi ri yayɨbi ran, ki tsro ri ki nyɨme yi bran. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Ai, a ran he kita nye ki kambu ri yi ran, biyi nye bi kambi ri bu sron mbi bi ri nyɨme ri ta ran. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Me tretre nyi riyi ka bibi riwa a ti ri tre ri miri wan, biyi nga wen tsro ri bi nyɨme ri ta ngawen wen tsro ri bi nyɨme ri ta ngawen.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ran ka tu kabru ri wawa wa ran hu Izhi ran.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Ran katu kabru ri wawa wana ri hu Izhi ran. Nji ri dindi ran to son si ri nji ri meme ti ran ko ka ngye ri ka kpan mba bu ka bru? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Kristo ran he kpan meme nji ran, ka wa hu Izhi wa kabru ri wawa wa ran ri hu Izhi ran. <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Ngye ri ka tra bre Izhi kabru ri tra yɨbi? kita ki he tra bre Izhi. Bibi riwa Izhi tre,&lt;&lt;Me son iwawa, me ri zren rimi mba. Nga me he Izhi mba, nga wawa wa he wa nji won.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />&lt;&lt; Ritu ngamba bi ka zhu rimi wawa wa ran hu Izhi ran bi ri ga ngambi, Izhi tre ri, ran bre wo ri kya riwa a zuu ran, ri ngamba nye me nyɨme ri yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />&lt;&lt;Me he A ti mbi, biyi bi he miri won ronron ri miri mba, Bachi riwa a he ri gbengbren wawu nye tre ngamba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Biyi miri vayi wawa me nyɨme yi, tunde wa ka tre dzi ri ta-e no ta ki tsri tumbu ri ko ngye riwa ari no kpa mbu nga sron mbu no zuu. No ta ki son rimi Tsitsri rimi sisiri Izhi.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kinklan sron Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Biyi tsro ri bi nyɨme ta. Ai, ki ran ti meme ti ri njo ri ran, ko ka ki kpa njo time ka ki ri sen njo ran. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Me ran tre ri nyi ritu me ri vu yi ri meme ti ran, bibi riwa me gbuchi la yi-e, ikya ri ran ri to ga yi ri nyɨme ta ran, ko ri kuu ko ri son si. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Me nyɨme ri yi branbran, nga me ri ri kpongawon ri yi; Isron won he ri tre ri de senkpa bran. Wawu yaa riwa ki so-a, me he ri kinklan sron bran.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Ka hu ri riwa ki ye ri meme Makidoniya ki ran fe son vri ran ko kutan ki kɨma iwanyu ri he, ri iwanyu nga sisiri ka sho rita ri sron. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Ama Izhi riwa ari de senkpa ri nji riwa a zhu ri sron, ran no ta senkpa ri ye Titus. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />A ran ritu ye wan nye ka kre ki ngɨri ran, ama itre riwa a la ta me nyɨme ri bi no senkpa. A la ta bibi riwa bi wa bi ri to wen bran, nga bibi riwa bi ti shnji sron ritu kya riwa a ti nga bibi yosron ri shogon won. Rinyi nye no wen sisron bran bran. <verse eid="2CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ko imbe won riwa me ngan a kpa sron mbi time, a ran suu wen sron ran. Ri sen me ti shnji sron ritu imbe won a kpa sron mbi time, ko riwa a he ri vi hari nye kakre. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />To bibi riwa kyawa wa he zizan me ti kinklan sron. Ko ri riwa me ri ngɨri riwa me kpa sron mbi time ran, ka meme ti mbi chuwo bi ri sran son mbi, shnji sron mbi he bi. bi wa ti Izhi, ritu ngamba bi ran hon fe kya rita ran. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Ritu shnji sron bibi riwa ti Izhi nye ri no nji no ka meme ti wan chuwo, ran kɨma ye ri Izhi, ri ngamba nye ari fe kpa chuwo nga a ran no no tre ri wawu ran to ran-ran ti ran, ama shnji sron riwa mgbumgblume nye ri ngiji nji hi ri kuu. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Biyi ya kya riwa shnji sron nyi bibi riwa ti Izhi riwa a ka dzi ri sron mbi a ngɨzhi ye ri yi. A no yi mbiye ri ti-u ran tre ri bi yɨbasi. A no yi bi ti fu, nga bi ri ti sisiri. A no yi bi yo sron nga bi ri he ri tichukpa. A no yi bi milan ki bi ri to bibi de yaa riwa wa de tsra ritu kya nyi, lele ko ri nkon ritan bi tsro ri bi ran ti meme ti ran. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Ri vi riwa me ngan mbe ri mu, me ran yosron ri nji riwa a ti meme ti ran, ko nji riwa wa ti meme ti ri wu. Tsede me ngan me ri milan bu tre-a riyi iri Izhi to ri bi nyɨme ta bran. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Ritu wan nye ki fe tre ri de senkpa ri sron mbu. A ran tre de senkpa ri sron mbu ka kre ran, ye luwa ki ti kinklan sron bran ritu bibi kinklan sron riwa Titus he riwu, ritu wawu mbi bi dzon wu ritu tre de senkpa riwa Titus fe. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Ko me ri la-u ri me kpongawon riyi, ishan ran ti wen ran bibi riwa ikya riwa ki layi a he kpunji, ngambame ikpo ngambu ritu mbi a he kpunji ri kusi Titus. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Ngha inyɨme riwa Titus he ri wu ri yi a sondu ri gbron bran riwa a taka ri rerembi wawu, nga bibi de mkpen riwa bi ti riwu ri vi riwa bi kpaa. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Me ti kinklan sron zizan ritu me nyɨme ri yi bran.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Ide riwa wa hu Izhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Zizan nganyi, imiri vayi ki wa no yi to kya riwa dindi ti Izhi ti ri wa hu Izhi ri gbu Makidoniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Wa so yaa bran ritu yaa riwa wa gra rimi wan, ritu kinklan sron mba bran a ngiji ye ri dindi ti bran ritu riwa wa no wari, ka hu ri riwa wa he rimi nchon yaa. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Me to ri wa de tsra ri gbengbren mba nga ran bran han riwa wa de ri sron riri, a ran ritu wa vu wa no wa de ran. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Wa ibreta ri ki no wawa nkon no wa dzon ta tindu, ritu no wawa ngawen no wa fe nkon gra rimi wawa wa dzon wawa wa he Tsitsri rimi meme Yahuda. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Wa de han kya riwa ki yo sron ri wa de. Rimi wan wa ka tu mba no Bachi, rimba waka katu mba no ta ngawen, ritu bibi riwa Izhi wa. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ri to ngamba, ki ka ibre Titus ri no tindu-a ran hi ri vu kpi riwa wa de ri sron riri ran kɨshuti ri bubu riri, tunde wawu nye gbuchi. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Ritu ko ngye biyi bi he kusi ko ri yosron mbi rimi Kristo ko rimi tre, ka rimi to kpunji, ko ri nyɨme tindu, nga nyɨme riwa bi he riwa rita. Ritu ngamba ki wa no yi ran ti ndindi ti rimi de ri sron riri.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Me ran ri vu yi ri gbengbren no dzon ran tsede me tsro yi bibi riwa wari wa yosron mba. Rinyi ri tsra bibi nyɨme riwa bi he ri wu ngbron nji. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Bi to bibi dindi ti Bachi mbu Yeso Kristo, ko ri riwa a he ri kongye, ka hu ri ngamba a kɨma he ka nji ri yaa ritu mbu, ritu yaa wan nye ki fe kongye ri kusi Izhi.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Ikya riwa me layi a he riwa no yi kre kya riwa bi gbuchi ti ri se riwa a vu yɨba, bi ran de kuklu ka kre ran, a he ritu bi yo sron mbi ri bi ti-u. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Zizan bi kre ndu ri bibi sron riwa bi gbuchi riwu, bi ti-u tsra ri senkpa mbi. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Ka nji he ri sron ri de, Bachi ri ngɨri ritu kya riwa bi no, ka bi de tsra ri senkpa mbi Izhi ran ri wa no yi ti kya riwa isenkpa mbi ran ke ran.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Me ran ri wa me ri no wari kya ri huri nga me ri no wari mbi ri wa a he ri yaa ran, me ti kongye tsra ri ko ngaa. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Ama ritu no wa ga ndu nji tsra bibi riwa a bi. Bi ka dzon wa zizan riwa bi he ri nkon ri dzon nga biyi ri vi riwa bi ran he ri kyari ran nga wawa wa he ri kyari, wawa ngawen no wa dzon yi ngawen. Ri ngamba ko ngye ri tsra. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Bibi riwa itre Izhi tre rimi ngan,&lt;&lt;Nji riwa a he ri kpi kigbu, a ran ri bran ri wu ran, nji riwa a he ri kpi fiwen, rimba ran he fiwen ri wu ran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Titus ri wa Kpan Ndu wan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Me ngiri ri Izhi riwa a no Titus no yosron riwa ari dzon yi, bibi riwa me wa. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Aran ra riwa a nyɨme riwa ari hi ri yi bibi riwa ki bre wu ri no ti ran, ama a wa ran ye bibi riwa a yosron ri wawu ri ye ri yi. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Ki ti vayi mbu ri nga Titus ndu ri wa a ti nde rimi dɨbu tre ri ro ri wa hu Izhi wawu. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Aran ngamba ka kre ran, nji wa hu Izhi wa chu wu no ran hu ta ritu ndu dindi nyi riwa ki ti ritu tsro Mkpen Bachi nga ki ri tsro ri ki he ri sron ri dzon. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Ki klu ri ritu no njo no ran kra ta tu ran ritu bibi riwa wa ngɨzhi de nyi riwa wa no ta ri sron riri. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Isu mbu he riwa ki ti kongye riwa a tsra, a ran ri kusi Bachi ka kre ran, ama nga ri kusi nji ngawen.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Ngha ki ti vayi mbu ndu ri wa riwa nkpa kigbu ki si tsra-u, nga ki ri to sron wan ritu kyawa kankankan zizan a yosron bran ritu nyɨme riwa a he ri wu ritu mbi. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Taka iri Titus he kpan ndu won nye, ri ame nga wawu ki ti ndu nyi ritu mbi nye, ngbron miri vayi mbu wawa wa he iwawa nji wa hu Izhi nye wa ti wa ndu, ndu mba ri ngɨzhi Mkpen ye ri Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Bi tsro nji wa nyi bibi nyɨme mbi nji wa hu Izhi wawa wa ti wa ndu wa wo kya riwa bi ti, rinyi ri tsro wa ri ikpo ngambu riwa ki ti ritu mbi he kpunji.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Aran tse me ngan riyi ritu dzon nyi ritu wa wa hu Izhi ri Urushelima ran. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Ritu me to sron mbi, me wuru wo ri gbobre ritu mbi ri wa nji Makidoniya, ritu ngamba me la yi ri bi yi nji Akaya bi milan son tu ri se riwa a vu yɨba, bibi tsi kpa nyi riwa bi he ri wu a no wa wulunde kuki ri nde ngawen. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Zizan ingye ngaan me ti miri vayi mbu wa nyi ndu ritu no wuru wo ri gbobre riwa ki wuru ritu mbi ri ndu nyi no he tre ri kuklu gyen ran. Ama me wa bi ri milan son, bibi riwa me ran tre ri sen ri bi ti. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Ritu ka me ye ri wa hu Izhi wari ri Makidoniya, me ran ri wa no wa ye fe yi bi ran milan de mbi ki ri ran. Ka a ti ngamba, Ishan ri ti wen ritu wuru wo ri gbobre riwa me wuru ritu mbi, a ran ame ri nkankshe won ran, nga biyi ngawen. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Ri ngamba me to ri a bi me bre wa miri vayi won wa wa ye ko ama me hu wa, ritu no wa kishu kya wa riwa bi tre ri bi de ritu no milan wa ki. Rinyi ri tsro ri bi de wa ri sron riri, a ran ritu wa vu yi no yi de ran.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ide ri Sron riri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Taka nji riwa a chu bi kpi tsawen ari sren kpi tsawen, ama nji riwa a chu bi kpi bran ari sren kpi bran. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Ko nga no de ri sron riri bibi riwa a yo sron, a ran ri kpa sron time, ko wa vu no de ran, ritu Izhi ri nyɨme nji riwa ari de ri ngɨri sron. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Izhi ri to no yi kyawa kigbu han kya riwa bi wa ritu ri ko shitan bi fe kya riwa bi wa riwa ari han ngamba ritu bi ri ti ndu ri dindi. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Bibi riwa a he ri ngan mbe Izhi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">&lt;&lt;Ari to no wa yaa ri wo hwri dindi ti wan ri he;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">ri wa a ran kre ran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Izhi nye ri de bi kpi no nji chu, nga ran no ri kigbu. Ritu ngamba Izhi ri no yi bi kpi riwa bi wa nga ran no no gbron ran ti wɨlo kigbu bibi riwa bi fon no wa nji. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Ko shitan ari tilɨbu sro ri yi rimi ko ngye ritu ko ngye riwa bi de ri sron riri bla vi. Ri nganyi nji kigbu wa ngiri ri Izhi ritu de riwa no wa hu rita.<verse eid="2CO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Ritu ndu nyi ri dindi ti riwa bi ti a ran ritu han ri wa tsitsri ka kre ran ari to ngɨzhi ngiri ye ri Izhi. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Ngha ritu kya riwa ari tsro riwa ndu nyi ri ngɨzhi ye ritu mbi, nji kigbu wa gbre Izhi ritu rerembi riwa a hu gon nyɨme riwa bi ti ritu tre ri ro riwa Kristo, nga ritu dzon de ri wo hwri riwa bi ti riwa, nga ngbron nji wawu. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Wawa wa bre Izhi ri yi, wari ri tika mbi ri sron mba ritu dindi ti nyi riwa a han gbengbren to riwa Izhi ti ri yi. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Ki ngɨri ri Izhi ritu de riwa a no ta, ide riwa a han gbengbren riwa ki bla!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Bulus a kpa Nghawan Chuwo Ritu ndu Wan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Ame Bulus ri tuwon, me ibreyi, ame riwa wa tre ri, nji ri tsri ngawan ka me he ri yi, ama nji ri wanyu, ka me ran he ri yi ran. Bibi reretu riwa Kristo! <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Ame Bulus me ibreyi, ran no wen me ti sron ri yi ran ka me ye ri yi, ritu me to ri me to vu wawa wa tre ri ikya riwa ki ti, a he ritu kyawa wa mgbumgblume nyi nye. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ko ri riwa ki kii ri mgbumgblume, ikya riwa ki ti a ran he bibi riwa mgbumgblume ran. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Ikya riwa ki wa ran he kyawa wa mgbumgblu me nyi ran, ama a he ri wa gbengbren Izhi nye. Ritu mba nye ki dzi bubu wawa wa senkpa riwa rimɨren ri che. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Ki zhu ko janyu ri bibi tan, nga ki ri dzi ko ngye riwa ari no ta ki ran to Izhi ran, nga kiri kɨma ko bibi rimɨren ri bibi tan ye ri Izhi nga tindu ri Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Ngha ki milan ki riwa ki gbi wawa wa ran wo tre ran ton,<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Bi ya kya riwa a he ri riraa rita. Ka njo tre ri wawu he wa Kristo, no nji wan no bru rimɨren, ran to ri kita ngawen ki he wa Kristo me. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Ko meri ri wuruwo ri gbobre ritu mgbembren nyi riwa mbu riwa Bachi no ta ritu no dzon yi a ran ritu no wa kpa yi time ran, ikyari ran no wen shan rimi wan ran. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Me ran ri wa no yi yonga me ngan mbe nyi ritu me ri no yi sisiri nye ran. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Ritu wari rimi mbi wa tre ri,&lt;&lt;Imbe Bulus wa he wa senkpa nye ri yaa, ama ka a he ri ta ri tuwan wawu ran he nji ri tre mgbamgban ran, nga itre wan ran he kyari ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />No bibi nji wanyi no wa to ri ikyari ran he nkan ri kya riwa ki ngan rimi mbe mbu ran, ki ran ti kyari nkan ri bubu riwa wa ran he ran.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Kita ki ran tsra ngambu ri wawa wa ban tu mba bran ran. Wawa bibi bi wa tsra tu mba ri ngamba nga wari ri kɨma tu mba ti nkan ri ngamba, wa he wa mkpran nye. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Ama kita ki ran wuru wo ri gbobre ran bibi riwa a he ran, tsede ki kri ri dren bubu riwa Izhi fon ri ta, riwa a kabru ri yi ngawen. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Ai, biyi ngawen bi he ri nyu dren riwa Izhi ka no wen, ritu ngamba me ran dza gran ran, riwa me hi ri yi ritu la tre Izhi ri ro riwa Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Ki ran ri wuru wo ri gbobre ritu ndu riwa wari wa ti dza gran bubu riwa Izhi ka yii rita ran ki yo sron ritu Yosron mbi no gbron bibi riwa ki to ti ndu bran rimi mbi bla vi ri bubu riwa Izhi kadzi ri ta, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />bibi riwa ki la tre Izhi ri kusi gbu riwa bi he, ki ran ri wa nde ri ndu riwa wa gbuchi ti-e riwa wa yo ran. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Ama bibi riwa imbe Izhi tre ri,&lt;&lt;Ko ngan riwa ari wuru wo ri gbobre, no wuru ritu Bachi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Ai, a ran nji riwa ari gbre ngawan nye wa nyɨme ri wu ran, ama nji riwa Bachi ri gbre wu nye wa nyɨme-u.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Bulus nga wa ndu Izhi ri che</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Me yo sron ri bi nyɨme wen ritu vi mkpran riwa me he, bi vu sron ri me. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Me ti huu ritu mbi, ngu bibi riwa Izhi ri nyɨme yi, me milan gran mbi ti ri Kristo, nga me ri wa no yi ki ri Tsitsri, ritu me ri kayi ka no, bibi riwa wa wa tsra ri Tsitsri no nji riwa wawu nkshi wan nye he ron wan. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Ama me ti sisiri ritu no wa ran gyuru yi bibi riwa iwan a gyuru Hawawu ran. iwan a gyuru wu ri wiwiri wan ran no ti meme ti, biyi ngawen irimɨren mbi ri to he ri meme, ri ngamba, bi ranran yo tumbi nga nyɨme rimi Kristo ran. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />A zhuka bi nyɨme ri kpa riwa njo ri yi, bi nyɨme ri tsro mba ritu Yeso, ko ri riwa a he nkan ri riwa ki la tre wanyi, nyɨme ri bibi Yuu riwa wa layi, ko ri riwa Iyu Tsitsri nye ran. Biyi bi kpa nyɨme ri bibi tre ri ro riwa manzɨrama, ko riwa a he ran ri riwa a he nkan ri riwa kita ki ngiji ye no yi. <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Ama me ran ban wu ri me to kya han,&lt;&lt;Wa ndu Izhi mbi nyi ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Me nyɨme ri me ran ri to tre ran ama me he ri to. Ki tsro yi rinyi ri ko nkon ri tan.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Me la yi tre Izhi ri ro nyi kuklu me ban kpanchi riwa a ran gbron ran ritu wa nzu yi ri ri kpanchi ri bran me ti meme ti nye mba? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Bi to mba ka me kpa nkren ri wa hu Izhi wari ritu meri ti ndu ri yi? <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Ri vi riwa me he ri yi me ran wa kya ri yi ran, nga me ran yo si ri yi ran. Imiri vayi wawa wa zhu ri Makidoniya nye wa ngiji kongye riwa me wa ye no wen me ran no yi yaa ri vi wan ran, nga me sondu ran tingamba. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Ritu bibi kpunji riwa Kristo riwa a he ri sron won a no wen me tre ri njo ran tsra ri meme Akaya ri ari tre me ka wuru wo gbobre chuwo. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Ngye ti ko me tre nganyi? Ritu me ran nyɨme yi ran, Izhi to ri me nyɨme yi! <verse eid="2CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Me sondu ran ti ngayin ri ka won ri dzon ri nkren ri yi, ritu me ri dzu wa,Wa ndu Izhi wa ri bran. Ritu ngye ki wuru wo gbobre ki tindu tsra iwawa.<verse eid="2CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Bibi nji wa nyi wa ran he wa ndu Izhi ri kpunji ran ama ri che. Wa kɨma tu mba ti ka wa ndu Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />A ran he kya ri sisiri ran ritu ko meme nji ri tu wan ari to kɨma ngawan ti ka ivren ndu Izhi wa kpan. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Ritu ngamba a ran he kya ri de sisiri ran ka wa tindu ri wu wa kɨma ngamba ti ka wa tindu dindi. Ri kre wan wa fe kya riwa a tsra ri ndu mba.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a Kpo Nghawan ritu Yaa riwa a so</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Me bru ri tre ri: No njo no ran yonga me timkpran ran. Ama ka bi yosron ri ngamba nye a he, bi ka nyɨme ri a he ka me tinkpran ritu ame ngawen me fe kpa riwa me kpo ngawon ri wu. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Bibi kpo ngawon riwa me ti nyi, a ran he ri ti Izhi nye me tre nganyi ran oon, rimi tre nyi me kpo ngawon ka me ti nkpran. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Ama tunde wari wa he riwa wa kpo ngamba bibi riwa wa mgbumgblume wa ti, no wen me tingamba ngawen. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Biyi kyumbi bi he ri wiwiri bran, nga ri vu sron riwa wa tinkpran! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Inde njo no yi gbre, bi to vu sron ri wu ko ran vu yi kya ra, ko ran sen yi, ko ran samgbren ri yi, ko ka ran wuru yi ri takpanran. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Ame ngawen, ishan ri ti wen me ri tre ri a he ritu ki ran senkpa ran ki ran ri ti kyawa wa nyi ran!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Ama inde njo vu sron ran wuru wo gbobre ri tu kyari nye, ame ngawen me vu sron me ri ti ngamba me. Ama ri nyi me tre ka me tinkpran. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Ka wa he Ibraniyawa nye? Ame ngawen me he ngamba, ka wa he Israilawa nye? Ame ngawen me he ngamba, ka wa he gɨzhi Ibrahi nye? Ame ngawen me he wa Ibrahi. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Ka wa he wa ndu Kristo nye? Ame me han wa? Me tre ka me sra nye. Hari me ti han wa, ri sondu lowen, wa tsi wen branbran, nga me ri gra ri nyu kuu ri nkpa kigbu. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Nkpa ton nji Yahuda wa tsi wen ri gbagba iwo setra don chu wa. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Nkpa tra wa kpanchi riwa Romawa wa tsi wen ri gbagba nga wari ta wen ri tita, mkpa tra, nvu wa ima wa yira ka me he rimi wan nga me kru rimi nne ŋran mbre. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Rimi wa zren won me dzon tu ri kyawa wa meme rimi nfron, nga meri gra ri wo wa yɨbi, me sondu si gra ri wo wa miri vayi won nji Yahuda, nga ri wo wawa wa ran he nji Yahuda ran, me sondu si gra wo wa meme ri nchon gbu, nga ri ji, nga rimi meme, nga riwo wa kpan wa che. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Me sondu si dzran, nga me ri si son yon nga la ma. Ri nkpa kigbu me ran fe kya ri ri ran, nga me ri son si, nga me ri ran he ri tsro riwa me suu ran. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Me ran bla ngbron kyawa sro ngaan ran, bla vi me he ri losron ritu wa nji wa hu Izhi bla vi. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Ka nji ran fe senkpa ran, a ri zhu mba ka a he ame nye, nga ka wa no njo no joku rimi meme ti, a ri kpa sron won time bran.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Inde a he riwa me wuru wo ri gbobre nye, to, me ka wuruwo gbobre ritu kya riwa a tsro kunyiren won. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Izhi to ri a ran he che nye me ti ran, wa wu riwa a he Izhi nga A ti Bachi Yeso Kristo no tilɨbu no he ki wu ri ran-ran kre ran. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Riwa me he ri meme Damasiku, rinkon ri gbu riwa a he ri ndoza chu Aretas a raa nkon ri Dimasuku ritu ran don vu wen. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Ama wa kpan won wa ngɨzhi wen rimi sisen ri kankan ri chon gbu, me ka jɨbu ri wo wan.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Kyawa riwa Izhi a la ri Bulus Rimi Raa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Me kpo ngawon ko ri riwa a ran ri ti ndu kya ri mon ran, ama zizan me tre ritu kya ri kusi nga raa riwa Bachi a no wen. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Me to nji ri hu Izhi ri riwa luwa ise wan he wuru don nza nye-e, Izhi a ban wu hi ri shushuwulu ri tre bibi ti gbengbren wa Kristo ko a he rimi kpa nye, ka a ran rimi kpa ran, me ran to ran, Izhi nye nkankshiwan to. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Me to nji-a wa ban wu hi ri shu ri shushuwulu, ko a he rimi kpa nye, ko ka a ran he rimi kpa ran me ran to ran, Izhi nye nkankshiwan to, <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />wa ban wu hi ri shu bubu riwa Izhi ri son, ri mu nye a wo kyawa riwa wa ran to la-u ran, bibi riwa nji ran ri to tre ritu wan ran. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Me wuru wo gbobre ritu nji nye, ama me wuru wo gbobre ritu kya riwa a tsro kunyiren won. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Me ri wa meri wuru wo gbobre, me ran ri ti mkpran ran ritu me la kpunji nye. Ama me ran wuru wo gbobre ran, ritu me ran ri wa no njo no ban wen han bibi riwa ari to wen ran, ri bibi riwa a wo ri me to.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Ritu me ran wuru wo ri gbobre ritu raa wanyi riwa wa de mamaki ran, tse wa tru lilo ri riwa a he ka nchon rimo ri kpa. Rinyi he ka vren ndu nye riwa meme nji ti-u ndu no ye no wen yaa nga ran no wen me ran kpo ngawon ran. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Imkpa tra me bre Bachi no ban lilo-a zho ri mo. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Ama a tre ri mo ri,&lt;&lt;Dindi ti won a tsra ri wu, ritu kunyiren won wa to gbengbren won.&gt;&gt;Ritu ngamba ri ngɨri me wuru wo gbobre ri kunyiren won nyi ritu no gbengbren Kristo no son ri me. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Ritu ngamba, me to bibi kunyiren won, nga bibi yaa riwa wa no wen, ri so yaa, nga zhuzhu ritu Kristo. Riwa me ran he ri senkpa ran, ri vi wan nye me he ri senkpa.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a Losron Ritu wa Nji Korentus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Me ti ka me tinkpran, ama biyi bi yo wen. Biyi nye riwa bi ri gbre wen ko riwa me ran he kyari ran, &lt;&lt;Wa ndu Izhi mbi wa rinkon-a.&gt;&gt; Wa ran han wen ran. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Izhi a ti kyawa ri de sisiri, nga kyawa wa ndzu sron dzu ri me rimi mbi, me ri tindu wan rimi tsro ri me he nji ri ndu Izhi ri kpunji. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ri nkon ri tan nye me tsro ri bi ran he ka wa nji wari wa hu Izhi ran? Ko ritu me dzu yi ri dzon ri nkren? Bi ka meme ti nyi rega ri mo!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Me wa meri ye ri yi ri mkpa ri tra zizan, me ran wa meri no yi yaa ran, ritu biyi nye me wa a ran nkren mbi ran. Aran bi riwa no miri no wa ban yaa wa ti mba ran tsede no wa ti no wa ban yaa wa miri mba. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Me ngɨri meri wuu wawu kya riwa me he riwa, nga ri tuwon ngawen, ritu me ri dzon yi ka me bru nyɨme yi, ko mba bi fon nyɨme riwa bi he wu ri mo rega nye mba? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Bi nyɨme ri me ran he yaa ri yi ran, ama iri ri tre ri me ti wiwiri ri yi nye, me gyuru yi ri che! <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Me sen yi hu ri nji wari rimi wawa me ti wa ndu ye ri yi? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Me ibre Titus no hi ri yi, nga me ri ti vayi ri rimi wa hu Izhi riwu, bi tre ri Titus senyi nye mba? Ko ame nga wawu ki ran he ri rimɨren riri ran? Ngha a ran nkon riri nye ki hu ran?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />To tunde bi yosron ri ki wa kiri kpan ngambu chuwo riyi nye Izhi nye he ito mbu, ki la kpunji rimi Kristo nga ko ngye riwa ki ti, biyi wawa me nyɨme yi ki ti ritu kiri dzon yi. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ritu me ti sisiri riri riwa me ye me ran ya ye fe yi bibi riwa me wa ran, nga biyi bi ran fe wen bibi riwa me wa ran. Me ti sisiri me ka ngɨzhi wanyu ye. tisron, nga sutu, nga kpande time, nga kran, nga nzu tu nga ngɨzhi wanyu ye. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Me ti sisiri ritu ka me bru ye ri yi Izhi won ri no wen shan ri kusi mbi, me ti sisiri ritu me ran ti shnji sron ran ritu kpanji riwa wa ti meme ti ri sen wawa wa ran ka meme ti ri zren ntran nga gungu nga bibi ti riwa a ran he ri shan ran.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Ifenton Bulus ri Kremkpen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Rinyi ri he ye won ri nkpa ri tra ri yi nye-en,&lt;&lt;Wa to tu tre ri ko bibi tan ri nyu shada nji hari ko tra.&gt;&gt;Bibi riwa ingan tre Izhi a tre. <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Ri ye won ri hari ri yi me ghɨron wawa wa ti meme ti nga ngbron nji wawu no wa ka ti meme ti chuwo. Zizan riwa me ran he ri yi ran, me bru ri layi bibi ghɨron nyi ritu ka me ye njo ran jɨbu ri de yaa riwa me de ran. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Ka bi wa bi ri to Kristo ri tre hu ri me, ko ngye kpunji tre mba Kristo ran hon he ri gbengbren rimi mbi ran, riwa a he ngamba a tsro gbengbren wan rimi mbi. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Ko ri riwa wa kpan-u ritu konkron ritu a ran senkpa ran ka hu ri ngamba a he riwa kita ki ran senkpa ran rimi wan kau ri ngamba ki he vri riwu he ri gbengbren Izhi ritu ndu riwa ki ti rimi mba. <verse eid="2CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Bi tsra tumbi to ritu bi ri to ko bi hu Yeso Kristo rimi nyɨme. Bi ran tsra ngambi ran to ko bi ran to iri Kristo he rimi mbi ran ka bi ran to ran, to ka bi joku rimi tsra mba nye mba? <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Me yo sron ri bi to ri kita ki ran kunyiren ri he wa ndu Izhi ran. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Ki bre Izhi ri no yi ran ti kya riwa a ran tsra ran. A ran ritu kiwa kiri kɨma tu mbi he ka kita nye ki dzran jɨbu ran, ama ritu biyi bi ti kya riwa a tsra, ko riwa nji wa ya ta ri kita ki kunyiren. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />kita ki hu gon kpunji, ki ran ti kya riwa ari kawan ri kpunji ran. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Ki ngɨri ka ki ran senkpa ran; nga kiri ri ibreno yi ran ti kya riwa a tsra.<verse eid="2CO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ritu wan nye me ngan mbe nyi ri yi riwa me ran he ri yi ran ritu ka me bru ye, no ran he riwa me no yi yaa ritu tindu ri gbengbren nyi riwa Bachi ka no wen ran, gbengbren ri mɨlan ti a ran ri dzi ran.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichi Bulus ri Krenkpen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Ri kre wan imiri vayi won, tse vi ri bi ti bi ri milan ki, bi wo ibrewon bi ri nyɨme ngambi bi ri son ri sikpa ri ngambi. Ri ngayin inyɨme riwa Izhi ri si sron ri he ri yi.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Chi ngambi ri vu ngamba ri nyime ri Tsitsri. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Wa Tsitsri wawu wa tre ri yi.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />No dindi ti Yeso Kristo mbu, nga nyɨme Izhi, nga katu kabru riwa Yuu Tsitsri no he ri yi wawu mbi. No he ngamba.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>